{"id":"vod_hh_65744","vodId":"65744","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"钢之炼金术师FA","name_cn":"钢之炼金术师FA","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第64集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/c712da56ef432ac2c0485556cf452be6.jpg"},"summary":"炼金术，一种建立在等价交换原则基础上的科学，将物质进行理解、分解、再构造，将一种物品变成另外一种。但是，这样先进的技术却不能进行人体炼成，这是炼金术绝对的禁忌。可是，拥有极高炼金术天赋的爱德华（朴璐美 配音）和阿尔冯斯（钉宫理恵 配音）兄弟，因为对母亲极大的思念不惜触犯禁忌。而最终的代价却是，爱德华失去了一条手臂和一条腿，弟弟阿尔冯斯只能将灵魂依附在一副巨大的装甲之内。终于明白一切的兄弟俩，为了恢复原状，寻求更多的炼金术知识，成为国家炼金术师踏上了寻找终极炼金物品——贤者之石的旅程。在不断的探索中，两兄弟终于发现了贤者之石背后的真相，对身处的这个军事化国家也有了更深入的了解。此时，面对国家、民族、家庭……炼金术的未来究竟在何处。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-04-26 11:18:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":64,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e9r13V3a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bmZO7r0d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bmZO7rpd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dPN764na/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bYEWV3pb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dNkL73ze/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bW6LW3ga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/eER8K3ka/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bo2VAxKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/av2lmEra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dBBN1kxd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/av2lmEVa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e31QYMQb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/egJZ7m6d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/axknoKre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e5yQANRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","